# Fetched and generated by the integration tests, into the crate
# directory, when MIDNIGHT_PP and the test static dir are unset.
# `bls_midnight_2p<k>` is downloaded public parameter material
# (3 MB at k=14 alone); `zswap/<k>/` holds keys the test resolver
# builds on demand. Both are reproducible; neither belongs in the
# history.
/bls_midnight_2p*
/zswap/
